      "cooked": "<p>It would be great if there were a way to create or load teams. &nbsp;Of course, the major teams would be a great start:</p><p>Freedom V</p><p>Freedom VI</p><p>Prime Wardens</p><p>Dark Watch</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>And then, if we could create our own custom teams and save them for later use. &nbsp;That would be awesome.</p>",
